WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.431
- It's gonna be so easy, and
I'm gonna look like an idiot.

00:00:03.431 --> 00:00:06.014
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:08.971
- [Narrator] You have a shot of whiskey,

00:00:08.971 --> 00:00:11.637
and two empty shot glasses.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:13.559
Can you make a bridge
between the empty glasses

00:00:13.559 --> 00:00:15.678
that supports the shot of whiskey?

00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:17.859
If you can, you get 20 bucks.

00:00:17.859 --> 00:00:21.650
If you can't, you get the shot of whiskey.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:24.424
- What? (laughing)

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:27.179
- In a previous life, I like to think

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:29.550
I could have been an architect.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.839
- Basically what I'm trying to figure out

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:33.298
is how to make this taut enough.

00:00:33.298 --> 00:00:35.991
- This is gonna go horribly wrong.

00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:37.948
- (snapping) Let's do this,
so I have to make a bridge.

00:00:37.948 --> 00:00:41.729
- I'm assuming there's
some folding involved.

00:00:41.729 --> 00:00:44.820
- I'm just gonna take you out
of the equation right now.

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.320
- Okay, that's not gonna work.

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:52.584
- I'm gonna spill everywhere!

00:00:56.099 --> 00:00:57.370
- I can't hold it?

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.787
I can't touch it?

00:00:59.852 --> 00:01:02.070
- Are you sure you're not
leaving out some tools?

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:03.291
Like some tooth picks?

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:05.962
- (laughing) This is going really well.

00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:07.210
- Why do I always do this to myself?

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.639
I come here and get frustrated,

00:01:08.639 --> 00:01:10.960
time and time again.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:12.951
- I wonder if it's like some sort of V.

00:01:12.951 --> 00:01:16.010
- If I pay you this $20,
can I get a hint? (laughing)

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:17.989
- Okay, is there a longer 20?

00:01:17.989 --> 00:01:19.189
Is this a shorter 20?

00:01:19.189 --> 00:01:21.272
- But if I try to like...

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.291
Really crinkle it up.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.191
That still is not gonna work.

00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:30.151
- What if I just rip
this $20 bill in half?

00:01:30.151 --> 00:01:32.151
- Oh my god, this is it.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.940
No, fuck.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:36.477
- Come on.

00:01:36.477 --> 00:01:40.644
I can do this, where is a
pep talk when I need it?

00:01:42.016 --> 00:01:44.800
- I don't. (laughing)

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:48.800
I wanna do this so badly
without you telling me.

00:01:51.409 --> 00:01:52.529
(sighing)

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:55.699
- Let's go back to square one, no.

00:01:55.699 --> 00:01:58.949
- (singing) I give up.

00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:02.009
- I give up, I give up.

00:02:02.009 --> 00:02:03.518
- Show me.

00:02:03.518 --> 00:02:05.260
- [Camera Man] Give up!

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.510
(laughing)

00:02:10.079 --> 00:02:10.912
- Alright.

00:02:14.181 --> 00:02:15.751
- [Narrator] Take the $20
bill and start folding

00:02:15.751 --> 00:02:18.242
long ways on alternating sides,

00:02:18.242 --> 00:02:21.409
until the bill resembles an accordion.

00:02:23.594 --> 00:02:27.060
Rest the folded bill on
top of the empty glasses.

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:31.038
Place the full shot of
whiskey in the middle.

00:02:31.038 --> 00:02:32.231
Collect your money.

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:33.938
- Are you gonna fold it up?

00:02:33.938 --> 00:02:34.771
- I did that.

00:02:34.771 --> 00:02:36.521
- Are you kidding me?

00:02:40.905 --> 00:02:42.072
- I'm annoyed.

00:02:44.706 --> 00:02:45.539
- What?

00:02:46.587 --> 00:02:47.420
- Come on.

00:02:48.508 --> 00:02:52.675
- But like, that's stupid,
and I'm gonna sip this.

00:02:53.864 --> 00:02:55.448
- Clink, ew I don't wanna do this.

00:02:55.448 --> 00:02:58.031
Oh my god, I already regret it.

00:02:59.947 --> 00:03:00.780
- Alright.

00:03:05.108 --> 00:03:09.275
I have to go get back to work. (laughing)

00:03:10.194 --> 00:03:13.694
- Pretty good. (laughing)

